{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "washtenaw-project-crankcase",
    "description": "PLAN.md §7.3.58: the PROJECT-domain input database of `project-crankcase` and `project-refueling` (both runspecs/), which moves.rs captures from the same SQL, over `onroad/default-database.esm` like `inputs/washtenaw-project.esm`, whose description says what a domain document declares and why only that.\n\nmoves.rs builds it from `characterization/county-inputs/washtenaw-project-crankcase/setup-project-crankcase.sql`: `washtenaw-project`'s SQL with a different network, which tools/build-scale-input-db.py writes to `inputs/washtenaw-project-crankcase/` -- `link` (link 1 on road type 4 at 30 mph and 1 mile, link 2 on road type 5 at 25 mph and 0.5 mile, and the off-network link 3 on road type 1), `linkSourceTypeHour` (link 1 is 80% source type 21 and 20% source type 62, link 2 60% and 40%), `offNetworkLink` (1,000 passenger cars and 50 long-haul trucks, the trucks idling 30% of the hour) and `opModeDistribution` (the user's start modes on link 3 for THC, CO and NOx start exhaust, round fractions per source type, identical across the three pollutant-processes).\n\nIT DOES NOT LOAD ALONE: it names no runspec.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "onroad",
      "domain",
      "project-domain",
      "scale-input-database"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "db_link": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/Link.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_link"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "output",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "The project's Link: 3 rows in county 26161, zone 261610, grade 0 -- link 1 on road type 4 (1.0 mi, 1,000 veh/h, 30 mph), link 2 on road type 5 (0.5 mi, 600 veh/h, 25 mph) and link 3, the off-network link, on road type 1.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_linksourcetypehour": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/linkSourceTypeHour.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_linksourcetypehour"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "4 rows: link 1 is 80% source type 21 and 20% source type 62, link 2 60% and 40%.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_offnetworklink": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/offNetworkLink.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_offnetworklink"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "2 rows in zone 261610: 1,000 passenger cars (start fraction 0.05, parked 0.5) and 50 long-haul trucks (start fraction 0.02, extended idle fraction 0.3, parked 0.6). ProjectTAG's Starts (`st_projectStarts`) and hotelling hours (`hot_projectHours`) start from it.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_opmodedistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/OpModeDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_opmodedistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "operating-mode"
        ],
        "note": "48 rows: the user's start operating modes 101-108 on the off-network link 3 at hourDayID 95, for pollutant-processes 102, 202 and 302, the same fractions for each (source type 21: 0.10, 0.10, 0.05 x 4, 0.20, 0.40; source type 62: 0.30, 0.10, 0.10, 0.05 x 3, 0.15, 0.20). PROJECT-domain StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator reads start modes from here alone (`sod_weight`); no row is at a running mode, so every link's running distribution is the generator's.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_runspecdomain": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/runspecdomain.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_runspecdomain"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "domain"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, modelDomain PROJECT, read by tools/build-scale-input-db.py from project-crankcase.xml.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_input_zoneroadtype": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/ZoneRoadType.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputzoneroadtype"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "activity"
        ],
        "note": "The project's ZoneRoadType: 4 rows, the default's at zone 261610 (tools/build-scale-input-db.py --copy), as in `washtenaw-project`.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "db_input_hotellingactivitydistribution": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "./washtenaw-project-crankcase/hotellingActivityDistribution.parquet"
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_inputhotellingactivitydistribution"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "domain",
          "hotelling"
        ],
        "note": "The project's hotellingActivityDistribution: 0 rows -- its copy selects zone 261610 from a default table whose rows are all at 990000. In PROJECT domain MOVES does not merge the default's at all (InputDataManager.java:2802-2805), which the model writes as `had_isMerged`.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
